       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SETCONDTRUE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ORDER-STATUS PIC 9(1) VALUE 0.
           88 ORDER-PENDING VALUE 0.
           88 ORDER-SHIPPED VALUE 1.
           88 ORDER-CANCELLED VALUE 2.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET ORDER-SHIPPED TO TRUE
           IF ORDER-SHIPPED
               DISPLAY "STATUS: SHIPPED"
           END-IF

           SET ORDER-CANCELLED TO TRUE
           IF ORDER-PENDING
               DISPLAY "STATUS: PENDING"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "STATUS: NOT PENDING (" ORDER-STATUS ")"
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.
